:INFO
Art. 85 Repeal of current legislation
The following Federal Acts are repealed:
1. Federal Act of 18 December 1970 on the Control of Communicable Human Diseases;
2. Federal Act of 13 June 1928 on Measures against Tuberculosis.
|

